NAME
    gcloud gemini gda-observability-settings - manage Gda Observability Setting
        resources

SYNOPSIS
    gcloud gemini gda-observability-settings GROUP | COMMAND
        [GCLOUD_WIDE_FLAG ...]

DESCRIPTION
    Manage Gda Observability Setting resources.

GCLOUD WIDE FLAGS
    These flags are available to all commands: --help.

    Run $ gcloud help for details.

GROUPS
    GROUP is one of the following:

     setting-bindings
        Manage Setting Binding resources.

COMMANDS
    COMMAND is one of the following:

     create
        Create gdaObservabilitySettings.

     delete
        Delete gdaObservabilitySettings.

     describe
        Describe gdaObservabilitySettings.

     list
        List gdaObservabilitySettings.

     update
        Update gdaObservabilitySettings.
